     ],
     "value": "(Microbial infection) Modulates the ability of SARS-CoV-2 to infect host cells through interaction with the spike protein (PubMed:36228039, PubMed:36735681, PubMed:36757924). Does not act as a SARS-CoV-2 entry receptor but sequesters virions and antagonizes in trans SARS-CoV-2 infection of ACE2(+) cells when expressed on nearby cells (PubMed:36228039, PubMed:36757924)"
    }
   ],
